# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
title    Town
composer Claude
about    Smoke from the chimneys and the well in the square: a slow waltz in G for clarinet and its echo over guitar, an accordion on the off-beats and an upright bass. The town has no enemies, so it only knows explore and treasure.
tempo    100
beats    3
steps    4
reverb   0.35

# moods (music/README.md); everything else falls back to explore
# mood explore:  lead echo guitar accordion bass tamb glock
# mood treasure: guitar accordion glock wonder

voice lead      clarinet   vol=0.75 pan=-0.15
voice echo      clarinet   vol=0.25 pan=0.45 rev=0.5
voice guitar    guitar     vol=0.5  pan=0.3
voice accordion accordion  vol=0.22 pan=-0.25 gate=0.6 center=D4
voice bass      upright    vol=0.75
voice tamb      tamb       vol=0.3  pan=-0.35
voice glock     glock      vol=0.25 pan=0.4  rev=0.5
voice wonder    celesta    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3 rev=0.6

# G C G D | G C Am-D G; the tune opens on the game's motif, 1 2 3 5 4 (G A B D C)
pattern A
lead      | G5------- A5--- | B5----- D6----- | C6------- B5--- | A5------- .--- |
lead      | G5------- A5--- | B5--- C6--- E6--- | D6--- C6- B5- A5--- | G5------- .--- |
echo      | .- G5------- A5- | -- B5----- D6--- | -- C6------- B5- | -- A5------- .- |
